            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, at’ Amaboko yanyu n’akomere, yemwe abumva mur’ iyi misi amajambo yavuzwe n’abavugishwa nanje bārih’ umusi itanguriro ryashirwaho ry’ingoro yanje, jewe Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo, ni rwo rusengero, kugira ngo rwubakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw iyo misi itarashika ata ngero zāboneka z’ibikorwa vy’umuntu canke z’ivy’ inka zirima, kandi nta mahoro k’ūwinjira n’ūsohoka kubg’ abarwanizi; kuko nateranije abantu bose, umuntu wese nkamuteranya na mugenzi we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko noneh’ amasigarira y’ubu bgoko sinzoyagirira nk’uko nabagiriye mu bihe vyashize, ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
