            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo mukwiye gukora n’ibi: Umuntu wese avugane ivy’ ukuri na mugenzi we, muce imanza ziroranye z’amahoro muri mu rukinja mu marembo yanyu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ntihakagire n’umwe muri mwebge yīgīra imigabo mu mutima wiwe yo kugirira nabi mugenzi we: kukw ivyo vyose ari vyo nanka, ni k’Uhoraho agize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
